      'There was a period of conflict. Residents faced threats and some community members were arrested. Villagers responded with a foot march from Nai Basti to the district prison and appealed publicly for support. Bhanmati describes wide solidarity, the release of those detained, and acceptance of the community\u2019s demands afterwards.',
